 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Decay icon0}}
| desc = Undying steals strength from all enemy heroes in an area, dealing base damage as he claims the enemy's strength for himself. Deals 2x damage to creeps.
}}
{{#lst:Undying/Decay Calculations|Table}}

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** In short, the ability utilizes the following formulas when interacting with both current and max {{M|health}} manipulation sources:
*** {{cf|expr}}
**** {{Code|Current[[Health|HP]] {{=}} (MaxHP + BonusHP × (CurrentHP + DecayBonusHP) / MaxHP}}
**** {{Code|Max[[Health|HP]] {{=}} MaxHP + BonusHP + DecayBonusHP}}

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|undying_decay_buff_counter}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** {{Symbol|Model Size}}
*** Increases [[model size]] by 2% per stack.
*** Does not affect {{M|collision size}}.

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Stack}} {{to}} {{Symbol|bonus str}}
** Applies the following trait and value changes per stack:
:: {{{!}} class="wikitable" style="text-align:center; margin-top:3px; font-size:80%;"
! style="width:80px" {{!}} Traits
! style="width:90px" {{!}} Current/Max {{Symbol|health|size=17px}}
! style="width:90px" {{!}} {{Symbol|bonus str|size=17px}} {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Main|size=17px}}
! style="width:90px" {{!}} {{Symbol|bonus regen-hp|size=17px}}
{{!}}-
! {{Symbol|Affect|Self|size=17px}}
{{!}} rowspan="2" {{!}} ± {{#expr:{{#var:Decay value2}}*{{G|bonus health}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus agh|size=17px}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Decay value2 agh}}*{{G|bonus health}}}}|agh|x}})
{{!}} rowspan="2" {{!}} ± {{#var:Decay value2}} ({{Symbol|bonus agh|size=17px}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Decay value2 agh}}|agh|x}})
{{!}} rowspan="2" {{!}} ± {{#expr:{{#var:Decay value2}}*{{G|bonus health regeneration flat}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus agh|size=17px}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Decay value2 agh}}*{{G|bonus health regeneration flat}}}}|agh|x}})
{{!}}-
! {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy|size=17px}}
{{!}}}

