{{Debuffnotes
| name = Soul Rip 
| desc = Does not affect [[debuff immune]] units.<br><br>However, they are considered valid units and counted toward both the {{M|spell damage}} per unit and {{M|heal}} value.
}}
{{Splblocknotes
| name = Soul Rip 
| desc = Secondary targets within the search radius still lose health.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Soul Rip icon0}}
| desc = Undying rips health away from all nearby units and uses it to heal an ally, or damage an enemy. Soul Rip can also be used to heal Tombstone.
}}
{{#lst:Undying/Soul Rip Calculations|Table0}}

* {{cf|facnotes}}
** Additionally grants the affected allied unit the following bonuses:
*** {{Symbol|Model Size}}
**** Increases [[model size]] by 15%. Does not affect {{M|collision size}}.
*** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
**** The affected ally has a green hue for the buff duration.
** Affects the following units as well, but does not provide any gameplay benefits:
*** {{M|Couriers}}
*** {{M|Creep-heroes}}, except units that can utilize {{M|strength}}.

